WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.190
A son wastes his inheritance
and comes home with nothing.

2
00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:06.470
His father runs to meet him.

3
00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:10.360
Elsewhere, a lawyer asks
Jesus a simple question:

4
00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:11.820
who is my neighbour?

5
00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:14.160
Jesus answers with a story.

6
00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:19.070
On the road from Jerusalem to Jericho,
a priest and a Levite pass a wounded man

7
00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:20.360
by.

8
00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:26.840
In Jesus' most famous stories, why is the
hero so often the person nobody expected?

9
00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:30.570
In this mission, you'll meet
three parables found only in Luke,

10
00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:32.820
and the questions that set them off.

11
00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:37.400
Then you'll weigh up whether mercy
is the heart of a believer's life.

12
00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:42.940
Your mission: explain why the hero of
Jesus' stories is so often the person nobody

13
00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:43.890
expected.
